{"n": 2, "grade": "faithful", "reason": "Remark 12: \"Their argument is rather involved, but Corollary 2 yields a simple proof\" of the Cleyton–Ivanov result that \"no compact 7-manifold can support a closed G2-structure σ whose underlying metric g_σ is Einstein unless σ is also coclosed\".", "doubt": true, "doubt_reason": "The object names a theorem (\"Cleyton–Ivanov theorem\") rather than stating it, which is close to the rubric's form-only near-miss for conjectures."}
